{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"aed950e1-ac05-4b02-9a21-783ae48d939d","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have all the data. Let me analyze and synthesize the L4 horizon summary. I need to:\n\n1. Extract and deduplicate methods across all 6 answers\n2. Classify by experiment environment (hardware platform)\n3. Classify by method category (fusion, tiling, pipeline, warp-specialization, multi-stream, etc.)\n4. Write detailed Q&A for each classification\n5. Label relationships between methods\n6. Output to the summary file\n\nLet me organize the key methods I've found across all answers:\n\n**From Q4.1 (Tile 切分与调度策略)**:\n- WELDER tile search (GPU/V100)\n- ThunderKittens LCSF + persistent grid (GPU/H100, A100)\n- Mirage Persistent Kernel / MPK tGraph (GPU)\n- FlashMoE persistent kernel + actor model (GPU/H100)\n- Fused MoE vLLM Triton (GPU/H100)\n- SLA Fused Attention (GPU)\n- GroupGEMM Comet (GPU/H100)\n- Ascend TBE/TIK MoE (NPU/Ascend 910B)\n- XLA TPU (TPU v5e/v5p)\n- AMD wave-level (MI300X)\n- PAT multi-tile kernel (GPU)\n- Block Order Scheduling (GPU)\n\n**From Q4.2 (指令编排与软件流水线)**:\n- Warp Scheduler latency hiding (NVIDIA GPU)\n- Software Pipelining cp.async (Ampere)\n- Hopper TMA + Warp Specialization (H100)\n- ILP Tensor-Vector Parallelism / FlashAttention-T (Ampere/Hopper)\n- ImFP (Implicit Fine-Grained Pipeline) / LiquidGEMM (Hopper)\n- Multi-stage Register Pipeline / Drawloom (Ampere)\n- Actor-Based Warp Specialization / FlashMoE (SM70+ GPU)\n- RoMeo Separate-Kernels + Async (Ada/RTX 4090)\n- TileLang T.Pipelined (Ampere/Hopper/AMD CDNA)\n- Wavefront Specialization (AMD CDNA)\n\n**From Q4.3 (Memory Hierarchy)**:\n- Register Tiling (MoE/DiT) - GPU\n- SMEM Bank Conflict Avoidance - GPU\n- L2 Cache Affinity Optimization / HyTiS - GPU\n- Block Order Scheduling - GPU\n- Coalesced Memory Access - GPU\n- MoE Bandwidth Reduction / LYNX - GPU\n- Fused MoE Kernel - GPU\n- L2-Resident Ring Buffer / Kitsune - GPU\n- FlashAttention IO-Awareness - GPU\n- Prefill/Decode Contention Guard - GPU\n\n**From Q4.4 (Tile Size/Shape 优化)**:\n- FlashAttention IO-Aware Tiling\n- FlashMoE Persistent Kernel\n- CUTLASS v3 Grouped GEMM\n- ThunderKittens\n- Infera Tile-Based Zero-Tuning\n- ChituDiffusion dEngine\n- WELDER Hardware-Aligned Tile Search\n- PIT for MoE\n\n**From Q4.5 (Kernel 调度框架/编译器后端)**:\n- Triton (block-level + auto tiling)\n- CUTLASS v3 (tile iterator + WGMMA + TMA)\n- CUDA Graph (kernel DAG)\n- CUDA Stream (multi-stream async)\n- FlashMoE (actor model persistent kernel)\n- MPK / Mirage Persistent Kernel (SM-level tGraph)\n- CANN/TBE/TIK (Ascend NPU)\n- XLA/TPU\n- MLIR-based (Diffuse/KernelEvolve)\n\n**From Q4.6 (实验环境)**:\n- Triton Fused MoE (vLLM)\n- SonicMoE 8-kernel suite (CuTe-DSL/CUTLASS)\n- CUTLASS v3 Grouped GEMM (TMA+WGMMA+Persistent+FP8)\n- CUDA Graph MoE\n- Mirage MPK mega-kernel\n- CANN/TBE CoC (Ascend)\n- XLA/TPU GLaM\n- FP8 MoE (PTQ)\n\nNow let me organize by:\n\n**Dimension 1: By Experiment Environment**\n\nGPU/NVIDIA: WELDER, ThunderKittens, MPK, FlashMoE, Fused MoE, SLA, CUTLASS v3, Triton, CUDA Graph, CUDA Stream, FlashAttention, ILP/TVP, ImFP, Drawloom, TileLang, Block Order, Coalesced Access, LYNX, Kitsune, Infera, ChituDiffusion, PIT, SonicMoE, FP8 MoE\n\nNPU/Ascend: CANN/TBE/TIK, Ascend Da Vinci MoE\n\nTPU: XLA/TPU, MXU systolic\n\nAMD: Wave Specialization, TileLang CDNA\n\nAccelerator (Groq): (no vault evidence)\n\nSimulator/Cross-platform: MLIR/Diffuse, KernelEvolve, TVM\n\n**Dimension 2: By Method Category**\n\n1. **Kernel Fusion (算子融合)**: Fused MoE, SLA Fused Attention, MPK mega-kernel, FlashMoE persistent kernel, FlashAttention, ChituDiffusion dEngine\n2. **Tile 切分与调度 (Tiling)**: WELDER tile search, FlashAttention IO-Aware tiling, CUTLASS tile hierarchy, ThunderKittens LCSF, Infera tile-based, PIT for MoE, Block Order Scheduling\n3. **软件流水线 (Pipeline)**: Software Pipelining cp.async, Hopper TMA + Warp Specialization, ImFP, Multi-stage Register Pipeline, TileLang T.Pipelined, SonicMoE Ping-Pong\n4. **Warp/Thread Specialization**: Warp Scheduler, Warp Specialization (producer-consumer), Actor-Based WS (FlashMoE), Wavefront Specialization (AMD)\n5. **指令级并行 (ILP)**: ILP Tensor-Vector Parallelism, dual-issue, MMA+ALU interleaving\n6. **Memory Hierarchy 优化**: Register Tiling, SMEM Bank Conflict Avoidance, L2 Cache Affinity, Coalesced Access, L2-Resident Ring Buffer, MoE Bandwidth Reduction\n7. **并发 Kernel 调度**: CUDA Graph, CUDA Stream, persistent kernel, dynamic parallelism, MPK event-driven runtime\n\nThis is a lot of content. Let me now write the comprehensive horizon summary.","signature":"aed950e1-ac05-4b02-9a21-783ae48d939d"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":99550,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":28032,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4f6ed193-c7d5-4e3a-a240-50119a026ec3","uuid":"8ec95e26-cb0a-4166-9af0-10d4ccd04808"}
